    },
    {
      "subId": "1112208",
      "subQuestName": "前往南天门寻找新的线索",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111220802"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111220802": {
            "id": "111220802",
            "speakerId": 10376,
            "speakerName": "昆钧",
            "text": "旁边还落着背篓…他确实是矿工。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220803"
            ]
          },
          "111220803": {
            "id": "111220803",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "喂，喂，能听见我说话吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220804"
            ]
          },
          "111220804": {
            "id": "111220804",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "钟离",
            "text": "看他的样子，应该是筋疲力尽才昏倒在此。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220805"
            ]
          },
          "111220805": {
            "id": "111220805",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "要叫醒他吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220806"
            ]
          },
          "111220806": {
            "id": "111220806",
            "speakerId": 10382,
            "speakerName": "矿工",
            "text": "我还能…能挖…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220807"
            ]
          },
          "111220807": {
            "id": "111220807",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯？嘴里嘀咕着什么东西…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220810"
            ]
          },
          "111220810": {
            "id": "111220810",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "钟离",
            "text": "如此执着，实在反常。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220811"
            ]
          },
          "111220811": {
            "id": "111220811",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "钟离",
            "text": "附近有个营地，先带他到那里安顿下来，再做打算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1112209",
      "subQuestName": "送矿工去附近的营地休息",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111220901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111220901": {
            "id": "111220901",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "钟离",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220902"
            ]
          },
          "111220902": {
            "id": "111220902",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "怎么样？他不会死吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220903"
            ]
          },
          "111220903": {
            "id": "111220903",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "钟离",
            "text": "他是劳累过度，陷入了昏迷。幸好，没有性命之忧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220904"
            ]
          },
          "111220904": {
            "id": "111220904",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "他怎么会累成这样？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220905"
            ]
          },
          "111220905": {
            "id": "111220905",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "我刚才听见他在念叨，说要挖什么东西，所以他是挖累了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220906"
            ]
          },
          "111220906": {
            "id": "111220906",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "钟离",
            "text": "不无可能。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220909"
            ]
          },
          "111220909": {
            "id": "111220909",
            "speakerId": 10376,
            "speakerName": "昆钧",
            "text": "嗯？他口袋里好像有什么东西…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220910"
            ]
          },
          "111220910": {
            "id": "111220910",
            "speakerId": 10376,
            "speakerName": "昆钧",
            "text": "这是…矿石的碎片？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220911"
            ]
          },
          "111220911": {
            "id": "111220911",
            "speakerId": 10376,
            "speakerName": "昆钧",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220912"
            ]
          },
          "111220912": {
            "id": "111220912",
            "speakerId": 10376,
            "speakerName": "昆钧",
            "text": "各位，我看了他口袋中矿石碎片的记忆。这些碎片是这个人从矿区带出来的，可见此人确实是我们要找的四名矿工之一。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220913"
            ]
          },
          "111220913": {
            "id": "111220913",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "钟离",
            "text": "那他会倒在这里，就更有意思了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220914"
            ]
          },
          "111220914": {
            "id": "111220914",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "被人带走，然后…被丢弃？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220915"
            ]
          },
          "111220915": {
            "id": "111220915",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "可既然要丢掉他，又为什么要把他一路带到这里呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220916"
            ]
          },
          "111220916": {
            "id": "111220916",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "钟离",
            "text": "除非发生了什么事，让他不得不掉队。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220917"
            ]
          },
          "111220917": {
            "id": "111220917",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "唔…唔唔…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220918"
            ]
          },
          "111220918": {
            "id": "111220918",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不行，太神秘了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220919"
            ]
          },
          "111220919": {
            "id": "111220919",
            "speakerId": 10376,
            "speakerName": "昆钧",
            "text": "啊，对了！看到这些碎片才想起来，我也有些东西要送给你们。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220920"
            ]
          },
          "111220920": {
            "id": "111220920",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "什么什么，有礼物吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220921"
            ]
          },
          "111220921": {
            "id": "111220921",
            "speakerId": 10232,
            "speakerName": "钟离",
            "text": "送给我们？为什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220922"
            ]
          },
          "111220922": {
            "id": "111220922",
            "speakerId": 10376,
            "speakerName": "昆钧",
            "text": "不瞒你们说，与老戴会合之前我总是犯迷糊，和你们一起查案，思路才变得清晰起来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220923"
            ]
          },
          "111220923": {
            "id": "111220923",
            "speakerId": 10376,
            "speakerName": "昆钧",
            "text": "我一直在偷偷庆幸老戴还找了你们几位帮忙。要是没有你们，只凭我一人，恐怕没办法查到这么多线索。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220924"
            ]
          },
          "111220924": {
            "id": "111220924",
            "speakerId": 10376,
            "speakerName": "昆钧",
            "text": "这些是我从集市淘来的水晶，别看它只是水晶，成色可是极其罕见的！一人一块，就当留个纪念吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111220925"
            ]
          },
          "111220925": {
            "id": "111220925",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好漂亮的水晶啊，颜色还会变！这样看，那样看…感觉都不一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1112110",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111211001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111211001": {
            "id": "111211001",
            "speakerId": 10424,
            "speakerName": "观察石块",
            "text": "（看起来…可能是石珀的一种？）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111211002"
            ]
          },
          "111211002": {
            "id": "111211002",
            "speakerId": 10424,
            "speakerName": "观察石块",
            "text": "（竟然能记录下我们需要的信息，真是神奇的石头啊。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1112210",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111221001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111221001": {
            "id": "111221001",
            "speakerId": 10424,
            "speakerName": "观察石块",
            "text": "（明明和普通石珀没什么区别…小昆却能从中读到记忆。）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111221002"
            ]
          },
          "111221002": {
            "id": "111221002",
            "speakerId": 10424,
            "speakerName": "观察石块",
            "text": "（多亏了这种石头，我们才能追踪到线索。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1112241",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111224101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111224101": {
            "id": "111224101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "请问你在这附近见过矿工打扮的人吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111224102"
            ]
          },
          "111224102": {
            "id": "111224102",
            "speakerId": 10379,
            "speakerName": "永贵",
            "text": "矿工？没见过。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111224103"
            ]
          },
          "111224103": {
            "id": "111224103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯…问问别人好了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1112242",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111224201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111224201": {
            "id": "111224201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你好，你看见过矿工吗？这么大的个子，一共四个！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111224202"
            ]
          },
          "111224202": {
            "id": "111224202",
            "speakerId": 10380,
            "speakerName": "小伟",
            "text": "去去去，别打扰我欣赏浮云！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111224203"
            ]
          },
          "111224203": {
            "id": "111224203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好不耐烦的样子啊，这个人…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111224204"
            ]
          },
          "111224204": {
            "id": "111224204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "算了，再问问其他人吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1112251",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111225101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111225101": {
            "id": "111225101",
            "speakerId": 10379,
            "speakerName": "永贵",
            "text": "唉，年纪大了，走不动路喽…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1112252",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111225201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111225201": {
            "id": "111225201",
            "speakerId": 10380,
            "speakerName": "小伟",
            "text": "哎呀别吵，没看见我在忙吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1112253",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111225301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111225301": {
            "id": "111225301",
            "speakerId": 10381,
            "speakerName": "小玲",
            "text": "我也是第一次看见那种情况…那些大人是睡着了吗？真奇怪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1112299",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111229908"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111229908": {
            "id": "111229908",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "喂喂，快看地上！这是我们要找的人吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}